		(uuid "1ec7b2c5-661f-4e18-a2ca-75808e671304")) 
	(text "LM5155 BOOST - ELECTRICAL DRAFT" 
		(at 25.4 20.32 0) 
		(effects 
			(font 
				(size 2.54 2.54)) 
			(justify left top)) 
		(uuid "c365eb32-d3de-4c1a-8fbb-b0b6dd992333")) 
	(text "DRAFT - BENCH PROTOTYPE. 12 V isolated input / 79.7 V nominal output." 
		(at 25.4 27.94 0) 
		(effects 
			(font 
				(size 1.524 1.524)) 
			(justify left top)) 
		(uuid "39c4c6f5-85c8-4d48-b797-13adebd38031")) 
	(text "Conditional bench target 15 mA. GAPTEC + 200 ohm preload cannot be assumed to support that load." 
		(at 25.4 35.56 0) 
		(effects 
			(font 
				(size 1.27 1.27)) 
			(justify left top)) 
		(uuid "cff058c4-a2e6-49ea-9c13-1b96c902233f")) 
	(text "HV_BOTTOM = GAPTEC pin 5 = rail-splitter negative input. It is NOT signal ISO_GND." 
		(at 25.4 43.18 0) 
		(effects 
			(font 
				(size 1.27 1.27)) 
			(justify left top)) 
		(uuid "db316497-5dc5-4939-89d5-0a62af15a47a")) 
	(text "HIGH VOLTAGE RETURN MAP\nJ1.2 and J2.2 = HV_BOTTOM.\nJ2.1 = HV_TOP.\nSignal ISO_GND connects only to\nrail-splitter MID downstream." 
		(at 292.1 58.42 0) 
		(effects 
			(font 
				(size 1.27 1.27)) 
			(justify left top)) 
		(uuid "66d3198d-d325-4231-8c6d-03196929ccf4")) 
	(text "PROVISIONAL LOOP NETWORK\nR8 = 191k; C3 = 47n; C2 = 68p.\nSimplified 500 Hz crossover target.\nActual phase margin, source/load\ninteraction and ESR are unvalidated." 
		(at 292.1 99.06 0) 
		(effects 
			(font 
				(size 1.27 1.27)) 
			(justify left top)) 
		(uuid "6fa93266-f308-4348-ae62-f62145c1841a")) 
	(text "SOFT START\nC7 = 47u nominal; require effective\nC >= 33u over 0-1 V. About 4 s nominal\nboost rise with 100u output bulk.\nStartup load must be controlled." 
		(at 292.1 139.7 0) 
		(effects 
			(font 
				(size 1.27 1.27)) 
			(justify left top)) 
		(uuid "97b5176e-8973-4ed7-a355-325475d2cea4")) 
	(text "SAFETY / INTERFACE LIMITS\nStopping switching does not disconnect\ninput from output. 100u at 80 V stores 0.32 J.\nPGOOD pullup is local VCC (~6.85 V),\nnot a Pico or MID-referenced signal.\nNo fault-safe output disconnect here." 
		(at 292.1 180.34 0) 
		(effects 
			(font 
				(size 1.27 1.27)) 
			(justify left top)) 
		(uuid "19e3e6bf-d5fb-4a0e-aeb2-4392ece858a1")) 
	(text "R1/R2 set 79.7 V. R9 = 0.270 ohm current sense replaces conflicting source metadata.\nL1 = SRR1280-102K, 1 mH. Q1 = FDMC86240, 150 V, specified at 6 V gate drive.\nExact R/C MPNs selected; effective capacitance and loop behavior require bench acceptance." 
		(at 25.4 223.52 0) 
		(effects 
			(font 
				(size 1.27 1.27)) 
			(justify left top)) 
		(uuid "46b2e293-93c0-482b-92d2-6f1001971cce")) 
	(text "Before powered integration: loop model/bench steps, inrush/UVLO, efficiency and\nGAPTEC 2 W budget, switch-node peak stress/snubber, thermal behavior, discharge/protection, isolation layout." 
		(at 25.4 246.38 0) 
		(effects 
			(font 
				(size 1.27 1.27)) 
			(justify left top)) 
		(uuid "1547cffb-653b-4488-8cc3-28fece1bbf3d")) 
